{"unit_id":"yinque91__dsh-live-narrator#feature-4","repo":"yinque91/dsh-live-narrator","commit":"6066190b743b01ea864c9608e46ef745ddef1174","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"小嘴 · 实时解说 的功能「输入框下方解说栏」：在会话 composer dock 插入一条常驻状态栏，展示当前播报文本、语音状态和开关；可用语音列表非空时还显示音色选择框。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:614-650"]}
{"unit_id":"yinque91__dsh-live-narrator#caveat-1","repo":"yinque91/dsh-live-narrator","commit":"6066190b743b01ea864c9608e46ef745ddef1174","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"小嘴 · 实时解说 使用前须知：语音输出依赖浏览器提供 speechSynthesis；代码检测到该能力缺失时不会播报，且开关提示浏览器不支持语音合成。开关与音色 URI 会保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:222-224","client.js:318-340","client.js:455-470","client.js:583-595"]}
